==German==
{{cardinalbox|de|12|13|14|zwölf|vierzehn|ord=dreizehnte}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|drīzehan|lang=goh}}, akin to Old Saxon {{term|thriutein|lang=osx}}. Ultimately from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*þritehun}}. Compare Dutch {{term|dertien|lang=nl}}, West Frisian {{term|trettjin|lang=fy}}, English {{term|thirteen|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|tretten|lang=da}}, Gothic [[𐌸𐍂𐌹𐍄𐌰𐌹𐌷𐌿𐌽]] (þritaihun).

